# Normalize line endings so `git status` doesn't show spurious CRLF/LF diffs
# on Windows checkouts (enrichment.csv, candidates.csv, and migration files
# have all shown up "modified" with byte-identical content because of this).
# Git stores LF internally regardless; eol=lf also checks files out with LF
# on every platform, so nothing round-trips through CRLF at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content -- never run line-ending normalization on these.
*.xlsx binary
